%% When a task stops: decision tree on run status. Rendered by hand as task-stops.html.
flowchart TD
    A[agent-workflow status TASK] --> B{status}
    B -->|starting or running| C[Keep watching; do not start a duplicate]
    B -->|needs_input| D[Answer the saved question with answer --file]
    B -->|failed: check or guard| E[Read the error and evidence, fix the cause, resume]
    B -->|failed: plan wrong| F[Revise the complete plan, then resume --rebind]
    B -->|cancelled| G[resume when ready]
    B -->|complete| H[Review the diff, evidence, and delivery state]
